==Strategy==
Bring 3 meatshields in addition to [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], and units that have above 360 range (such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] or any heavy hitting [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]). [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] will also work.

Just keep spamming everything. The Angelic Gories are the main problem: that's what Ramen Cat is here for. The Call Center Cats are not a huge threat as they attack quite slowly.

